<title>USA: FSA says has capacity for Philadelphia Gas Works.</title>
<headline>FSA says has capacity for Philadelphia Gas Works.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Monday it has remaining secondary insurance capacity for Philadelphia Gas Works revenue bonds.</p>
<p>Capacity is limited and is available on a first-come, first-served basis. For more information, call 212-826-0601.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
